      "updated": 1794409137707,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Key\nBlack: expected in a first-pass design (minimum bar)\nGreen: added when drilled into a specific area\nRed Q#: interviewer probe (see panel on the right)\nBlue 1-7: numbered request flow\nYellow: the calculator, sole source of duty figures\nArrow: caller to callee; dashed = async / control / auth\nFirst pass joins the black boxes directly (gateway to\norchestrator to retrieval); the green queue and\ninternal ALB are added when drilling in",
      "originalText": "Key\nBlack: expected in a first-pass design (minimum bar)\nGreen: added when drilled into a specific area\nRed Q#: interviewer probe (see panel on the right)\nBlue 1-7: numbered request flow\nYellow: the calculator, sole source of duty figures\nArrow: caller to callee; dashed = async / control / auth\nFirst pass joins the black boxes directly (gateway to\norchestrator to retrieval); the green queue and\ninternal ALB are added when drilling in",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "sd0003SbHpt0mpAiRL",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "a3"
    },
    {
