      "seed": 1128466621,
      "version": 165,
      "versionNonce": 1776587540,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794409137707,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Request flow (chat)\n1  User asks a question in the Amplify-hosted web UI; API Gateway authenticates, throttles and validates\n2  An orchestrator worker takes the turn (via SQS once added), loads history (DynamoDB), applies the input guardrail and classifies intent\n3  Guidance turns only: rewrite query, check cache, hybrid search, re-rank, top-k chunks with source URLs (calc-only turns skip retrieval)\n4  Prompt construction: Part 2 system prompt + chunks + history, sent to the Bedrock LLM\n5  If a £ figure is needed, the LLM requests the calculator tool; the orchestrator calls it and returns the result unchanged\n6  Output guardrail (sync stream mode) + validator: prose streams, a sentence with a £ is held until every figure is verified; citations checked\n7  Answer and citations streamed back over the WebSocket; turn stored, trace and metrics emitted\nPath B: /calculate goes straight to the calculator (deterministic, no LLM)",
      "originalText": "Request flow (chat)\n1  User asks a question in the Amplify-hosted web UI; API Gateway authenticates, throttles and validates\n2  An orchestrator worker takes the turn (via SQS once added), loads history (DynamoDB), applies the input guardrail and classifies intent\n3  Guidance turns only: rewrite query, check cache, hybrid search, re-rank, top-k chunks with source URLs (calc-only turns skip retrieval)\n4  Prompt construction: Part 2 system prompt + chunks + history, sent to the Bedrock LLM\n5  If a £ figure is needed, the LLM requests the calculator tool; the orchestrator calls it and returns the result unchanged\n6  Output guardrail (sync stream mode) + validator: prose streams, a sentence with a £ is held until every figure is verified; citations checked\n7  Answer and citations streamed back over the WebSocket; turn stored, trace and metrics emitted\nPath B: /calculate goes straight to the calculator (deterministic, no LLM)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "sd0009Eq2pKPH4Dwya",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "a9"
    },
