      "updated": 1794408629014,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Amazon API Gateway (two APIs)\n- /chat: WebSocket API, streaming\n- /calculate: REST API with usage\n  plans + request validation\n- custom domains (Route 53)\n- throttling on both\n- WAF on REST; /chat goes via\n  CloudFront + WAF (not drawn)",
      "originalText": "Amazon API Gateway (two APIs)\n- /chat: WebSocket API, streaming\n- /calculate: REST API with usage\n  plans + request validation\n- custom domains (Route 53)\n- throttling on both\n- WAF on REST; /chat goes via\n  CloudFront + WAF (not drawn)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
