      "text": "AI Orchestrator service\nECS Fargate, scales on queue depth\n- Intent (small model): guidance /\n  calc / both; calc-only skips RAG\n- Bedrock Converse API with tool\n  use; it runs the tool calls\n- Prompt construction (Part 2\n  prompt, versioned)\n- Citation assembly + streaming",
