      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794408629014,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Security and privacy\n- Cognito auth; IAM least privilege per service\n- KMS encryption at rest; TLS everywhere\n- Secrets Manager; no keys in code or config\n- Private subnets + VPC endpoints (Bedrock, S3)\n- Data minimisation: only the calculator inputs;\n  PII redacted before LLM and logs",
      "originalText": "Security and privacy\n- Cognito auth; IAM least privilege per service\n- KMS encryption at rest; TLS everywhere\n- Secrets Manager; no keys in code or config\n- Private subnets + VPC endpoints (Bedrock, S3)\n- Data minimisation: only the calculator inputs;\n  PII redacted before LLM and logs",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "sd1281JUIGD0leaPDx",
