      "updated": 1794408259519,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Evaluation and release (LLMOps)\n- Golden Q&A set + calculator boundary cases\n- Bedrock Evaluations / RAGAS run in CI\n- Release gate on prompt, model or index change\n- User feedback (thumbs) to review queue,\n  then into the golden set\n- Versions pinned; canary + rollback",
      "originalText": "Evaluation and release (LLMOps)\n- Golden Q&A set + calculator boundary cases\n- Bedrock Evaluations / RAGAS run in CI\n- Release gate on prompt, model or index change\n- User feedback (thumbs) to review queue,\n  then into the golden set\n- Versions pinned; canary + rollback",
