      "updated": 1794408259519,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Resilience and scale\n- Stateless services scale out (Fargate, Lambda)\n- Bedrock quotas, provisioned throughput,\n  cross-region inference\n- Retries with backoff; circuit breaker on tools\n- Degraded mode: calculator-only + GOV.UK links\n- Multi-AZ; backups for DynamoDB and S3",
      "originalText": "Resilience and scale\n- Stateless services scale out (Fargate, Lambda)\n- Bedrock quotas, provisioned throughput,\n  cross-region inference\n- Retries with backoff; circuit breaker on tools\n- Degraded mode: calculator-only + GOV.UK links\n- Multi-AZ; backups for DynamoDB and S3",
