      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794409137707,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How do you ingest, chunk and keep official guidance current?",
      "originalText": "How do you ingest, chunk and keep official guidance current?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b8M"
    },
    {
      "id": "sd1876c0eiP2inS8gi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3502.5,
      "y": 586,
      "width": 1995.1999999999998,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 50696782,
      "version": 41,
      "versionNonce": 1435330215,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794409137707,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Look for: Scheduled fetch (GOV.UK Content API), content-hash diff, re-process only changed docs. Raw docs versioned in S3 for provenance. Heading-aware chunks with overlap plus metadata (URL, section, last-updated).\nBuild a new index version (unchanged chunks reuse their stored embeddings), run the eval gate, then swap the alias so users never see a half-built index.",
      "originalText": "Look for: Scheduled fetch (GOV.UK Content API), content-hash diff, re-process only changed docs. Raw docs versioned in S3 for provenance. Heading-aware chunks with overlap plus metadata (URL, section, last-updated).\nBuild a new index version (unchanged chunks reuse their stored embeddings), run the eval gate, then swap the alias so users never see a half-built index.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b8N"
    },
