      "updated": 1794409137707,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How does RAG pick these documents, and which similarity metric would you use?",
      "originalText": "How does RAG pick these documents, and which similarity metric would you use?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b8Q"
    },
    {
      "id": "sd1880B5mip4FRdNSl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3502.5,
      "y": 701,
      "width": 1967.36,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1127992590,
      "version": 41,
      "versionNonce": 1806341879,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794409137707,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Look for: Embed the query and find approximate nearest neighbours (HNSW) in vector space. Cosine similarity, because direction carries the meaning and magnitude doesn't ('chunks vary in size' on its own is a weak\nreason). Hybrid with BM25 for exact terms such as 'first-time buyer' or 'higher rates' (on pgvector: Postgres full-text search in place of BM25, and a table swap in place of the index alias). Re-rank, then top-k\ntrades recall against context size.",
      "originalText": "Look for: Embed the query and find approximate nearest neighbours (HNSW) in vector space. Cosine similarity, because direction carries the meaning and magnitude doesn't ('chunks vary in size' on its own is a weak\nreason). Hybrid with BM25 for exact terms such as 'first-time buyer' or 'higher rates' (on pgvector: Postgres full-text search in place of BM25, and a table swap in place of the index alias). Re-rank, then top-k\ntrades recall against context size.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b8R"
    },
