      "updated": 1794409137707,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q8",
      "originalText": "Q8",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "sd1889Uwv9TYuNE9Ie",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b8b"
    },
    {
      "id": "sd1891P8reMDyPQuQT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3502.5,
      "y": 1075,
      "width": 881.5999999999999,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 234053390,
      "version": 40,
      "versionNonce": 1793258421,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794409137707,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "For the vector store, would you favour availability or consistency, and how?",
      "originalText": "For the vector store, would you favour availability or consistency, and how?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b8c"
    },
    {
      "id": "sd1892yOTNLKgP8kXD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3502.5,
      "y": 1106,
      "width": 1967.36,
      "height": 80,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1854950734,
      "version": 41,
      "versionNonce": 1626019778,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794409137707,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Look for: Read-heavy, rarely changing corpus, so favour availability with replicas across AZs. A consistent view of each version comes from the alias swap. Can explain the general theory: quorums (W + R > N gives\nstrong consistency) and consistent hashing (a hash ring moves few keys when nodes are added, unlike hash mod N). Notes that this describes Dynamo-style stores; OpenSearch uses primary and replica shards and, as a\nmanaged service, handles it for you. Tax rules don't rely on strong consistency (AppConfig rolls out gradually and clients cache it): rules are effective-dated and published before they take effect, and each\ncalculation selects by completion date, so a briefly stale cache still gives the right answer.",
      "originalText": "Look for: Read-heavy, rarely changing corpus, so favour availability with replicas across AZs. A consistent view of each version comes from the alias swap. Can explain the general theory: quorums (W + R > N gives\nstrong consistency) and consistent hashing (a hash ring moves few keys when nodes are added, unlike hash mod N). Notes that this describes Dynamo-style stores; OpenSearch uses primary and replica shards and, as a\nmanaged service, handles it for you. Tax rules don't rely on strong consistency (AppConfig rolls out gradually and clients cache it): rules are effective-dated and published before they take effect, and each\ncalculation selects by completion date, so a briefly stale cache still gives the right answer.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b8d"
    },
