      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794409137707,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How would tool calling be implemented, and for what purposes?",
      "originalText": "How would tool calling be implemented, and for what purposes?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b9oVV"
    },
    {
      "id": "sdQ16look",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3502.5,
      "y": 2106,
      "width": 1967.36,
      "height": 60.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1726519826,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 734954389,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794409137707,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Look for: The model is given tool definitions (name, description, input schema) and decides from those and the conversation when to request one. It never runs a tool itself: the orchestrator validates the inputs,\nmakes the call, returns the result and loops until the model answers. Used wherever an answer must come from a system of record and not from the model: here, the calculator for every duty figure. A candidate may\npropose further tools (for example guidance search or a handoff); judge the reasoning, not the list. Caps the loop steps and handles tool errors explicitly.",
      "originalText": "Look for: The model is given tool definitions (name, description, input schema) and decides from those and the conversation when to request one. It never runs a tool itself: the orchestrator validates the inputs,\nmakes the call, returns the result and loops until the model answers. Used wherever an answer must come from a system of record and not from the model: here, the calculator for every duty figure. A candidate may\npropose further tools (for example guidance search or a handoff); judge the reasoning, not the list. Caps the loop steps and handles tool errors explicitly.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b9oVVV"
    },
